    {
      "text": "Reports per-change status",
      "passed": true,
      "evidence": "Naive Claude would report some kind of status after attempting each change. General assistant behavior includes summarizing completed work. However, the report would lack the structured table format (Tasks, Quality, Browser, Docs columns) and the Step 8 final report structure."
