      "evidence": "SKILL.md Step 3: 'Determine branch name: feature/<issue-number>/<change-name>... Create git worktree: git worktree add /tmp/worktrees/<app>-<change-name> -b feature/<issue-number>/<change-name> origin/development'. Guardrails: 'Branch naming: Always feature/<issue-number>/<change-name> based off origin/development'."
